        <div class="process-world" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="process-core"><span id="process-core-label">DISCOVER</span><i></i></div>
          <div class="process-ring process-ring--a"></div>
          <div class="process-ring process-ring--b"></div>
          <div class="process-orbit-dot"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="process-steps">
          <article class="process-step is-active" data-process="DISCOVER"><span>01</span><div><h3>Find the leverage</h3><p>Study the workflow, users, tools, constraints and outcome worth changing.</p></div></article>
          <article class="process-step" data-process="DESIGN"><span>02</span><div><h3>Design the system</h3><p>Define the interface, model roles, permissions, data and human handoffs.</p></div></article>
          <article class="process-step" data-process="BUILD"><span>03</span><div><h3>Ship the useful core</h3><p>Prototype the smallest version that can survive real work.</p></div></article>
          <article class="process-step" data-process="TEST"><span>04</span><div><h3>Stress the weak points</h3><p>Use real scenarios to improve reliability, clarity and control.</p></div></article>
          <article class="process-step" data-process="DEPLOY"><span>05</span><div><h3>Deploy and transfer</h3><p>Launch with ownership, documentation and a path for improvement.</p></div></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

